\newlabel{tab:purity}{{3}{12}{Ground-truth-free tuning criteria compared, per locus: selecting the setting (of the same 8 as Table~\ref {tab:sensitivity}) with the highest CV accuracy vs.\ the highest $\theta _{\text {top}} \times $ purity$_{\text {top}}$ (``concentration''), neither of which uses the causal SNP position. A match means the criterion happened to select the oracle-best setting from Table~\ref {tab:sensitivity}}{table.3}{}}
